        "text": "If yes, is this enough or still need to change something here\n```version: \"\"\n\nservices:\n  pgdatabase:\n    image: postgres:13\n    environment:\n      - POSTGRES_USER=root\n      - POSTGRES_PASSWORD=root\n      - POSTGRES_DB=ny_taxi\n    volumes:\n      - \".\/ny_taxi_postgres_data:\/var\/lib\/postgresql\/data:rw\"\n    ports:\n      - \"5432:5432\"\n  pgadmin:\n    image: dpage\/pgadmin4\n    environment:\n      - PGADMIN_DEFAULT_EMAIL=admin@admin.com\n      - PGADMIN_DEFAULT_PASSWORD=root\n    volumes:\n      - \"pgadmin_conn_data:\/var\/lib\/pgadmin:rw\"\n    ports:\n      - \"8080:80\"\n\nvolumes:\n  pgadmin_conn_data:```",
